{"title":"2024 BmMT Individual Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_BmMT_Individual_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the largest integer less than 2024 that leaves a remainder of 20 when divided by 24.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_BmMT_Individual_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the integer has a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, then it can represented as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/1/3e1ad50d17edb2cbda122e6baf5e2c90b3605825.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24k + 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"70\" height=\"16\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is some integer. Since this integer is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5711c8d31d3bc3119aba377c9bda0f9dfb14e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/2/9c2f547eb0024f36b8290262e0eac1cebb15d4a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24k + 20 &lt; 2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"131\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/7/9375bd13b815ae29858937b761748f8c6131648f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24k &lt; 2024 - 20 = 2004$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"192\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/e/8fe8802bf414b3a4f50b767ebe6bad942bb38625.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k &lt; 167$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Using this, we can then see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> can be at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/1/9c1ad4a48099624f3bbfc16590f9be2d29351d61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$83$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer, so the number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/1/bd1b0f1d4e8adc2bc8f549cdaaf224320fe38ac7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24 \\times 83 + 20 = 1992 + 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"202\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/b/7eb3214a483b9d8bb7e3d5011628089cb0f5d343.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{2012}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"49\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_BmMT_Individual_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5711c8d31d3bc3119aba377c9bda0f9dfb14e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> gives a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. However, we want a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the number we want is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/b/3db00fe92fe1cefd600b78575ee0c35c3d32c25a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024 + 12 - 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" /> (subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to make the number less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5711c8d31d3bc3119aba377c9bda0f9dfb14e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />), or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/b/7eb3214a483b9d8bb7e3d5011628089cb0f5d343.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{2012}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"49\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>¬anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018025542\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 103/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4043/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37851:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018025542 and revision id 292472. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}